// Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B (Qwen) — Model configuration
// Source: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B (released 2026-08)
// Verified against the model card, chat_template.jinja, config.json and
// generation_config.json.
//
// The open-weight base of the hosted Qwen3.8-Max: model_type
// "qwen3_5_moe_text", 2.4T total / 95B active. TEXT-ONLY — the card says the
// hosted Max variant adds vision and a non-thinking mode, and this checkpoint has
// neither, so imageInput is false and thinking cannot be disabled.
//
// NOTE: These params work for ANY quantization variant (FP8, GGUF, AWQ, etc.).
// Preset matching is substring-based, so a preset for the base model applies to
// any served variant whose id contains it. The user model entry keeps
// its exact server model id; the preset does not rename it.
//
// ⚠️ THINKING CANNOT BE DISABLED. The template raises
// 'Disabling thinking is not supported.' when enable_thinking is false, and the
// card's own example annotates it "on by default; should not be turned off".
// There is therefore no thinking-off mode — the effort ladder bottoms out at
// "low".
//
// Reasoning depth (top-level request param, as the card's example sends it):
//   - `reasoning_effort`: xhigh (default) | medium | low. The template raises
//     'Unexpected reasoning effort ... Supported types are xhigh (default),
//     medium, and low.' for anything else.
//   - `preserve_thinking: true` — card: "reasoning context from historical
//     messages is retained via preserve_thinking"; on by default for this family
//     and sent explicitly, exactly as the shipped Qwen3.8-27B / Flash-Next
//     presets do.
//
// Sampling (card, and generation_config.json ships the same core trio):
//   temperature=1.0, top_p=0.95, top_k=20, min_p=0.0, presence_penalty=0.0,
//   repetition_penalty=1.0 — one recipe for the whole effort ladder.
//
// Token budgets (262,144 native, card: extensible to 1,010,000): ladder
// [32768, 16384, 8192]. The head is this extension's budget for a native 256K
// serve window (~229K input left); RoPE/YaRN extension is a server-side opt-in
// this preset deliberately does not assume.
//
// To apply manually, merge "config" into an existing model entry.
// Keep that entry's id, server and actual server model ID unchanged.


{
  "presetVersion": 1,
  "match": ["Qwen3.8-2.4T"],
  "meta": {
    "source": "https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B",
    "verified": "2026-11-10",
    "notes": "Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B (qwen3_5_moe_text, text-only, 262K native). Thinking is mandatory - the template raises on enable_thinking:false - so effort maps xhigh/medium/low with no off switch. preserve_thinking on. Card sampling temp=1.0, top_p=0.95, top_k=20."
  },
  "config": {
    "displayName": "Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B",
    "family": "qwen3_5_moe_text",
    "maxOutputTokens": [32768, 16384, 8192],
    "capabilities": {
      "toolCalling": true,
      "imageInput": false
    },
    "defaultParams": {
      "temperature": 1.0,
      "top_p": 0.95,
      "top_k": 20,
      "min_p": 0.0,
      "presence_penalty": 0.0,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.0,
      "chat_template_kwargs": {
        "enable_thinking": true,
        "preserve_thinking": true
      }
    },
    "modelModes": {
      "xhigh": {
        "reasoning_effort": "xhigh"
      },
      "medium": {
        "reasoning_effort": "medium"
      },
      "low": {
        "reasoning_effort": "low"
      }
    },
    "defaultMode": "xhigh"
  }
}
